Package: reach.postproc
Title: Autoregressive Error Updating for Flood Forecasting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Payne", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jonathan.payne@example.org")
Description: S7 classes and data.table-based functions for inspecting,
    constructing, assessing and applying autoregressive and autoregressive
    moving-average error models used in operational flood forecasting.
